Package: DRwinStats
Type: Package
Title: Doubly Robust Win Statistics for Randomized Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Xi", "Fang", role = "aut"),
    person("Fan", "Li", email = "fan.f.li@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Estimates win, loss, and tie probabilities at specified restriction
    times for prioritized terminal and nonterminal event outcomes in individually
    randomized and cluster-randomized trials. Combines outcome regression and
    inverse probability of censoring weighting with both participant censoring
    corrections, baseline covariate adjustment, and analytic variance estimation
    that includes nuisance estimation. Provides formula interfaces, proportional
    hazards and Kaplan-Meier working models, several Archimedean survival copulas,
    cluster-average and individual-average estimands.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices
Suggests: knitr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C++17
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
